		<Item class="LocalScript" referent="RBXFE1568E7F07948E88AD5577E4818C90C">
			<Properties>
				<ProtectedString name="Source"><![CDATA[local Players = game:GetService("Players")
local ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage")

local gui = script.Parent
local main = gui.MainFrame
local catalogue = main.InnerFrame
local cards = {catalogue.CarrotFrame, catalogue.PotatoFrame}
local details = main.ItemSellFrame
local header = main.HeaderFrame

local function resize()
    local screen = gui.AbsoluteSize
    if screen.X <= 0 or screen.Y <= 0 then return end

    local narrow = screen.X < 600
    local short = screen.Y < 500
    local desktopScale = math.clamp(math.min(screen.X / 1366, screen.Y / 768), 1, 1.35)
    local width = math.min(screen.X * (narrow and 0.9 or 0.86), 800 * desktopScale)
    local height = math.min(screen.Y * (narrow and 0.84 or short and 0.8 or 0.82), narrow and 720 or 560 * desktopScale)
    local compact = short and width >= 500

    main.ResponsiveMaxSize.MaxSize = Vector2.new(800 * desktopScale, narrow and 720 or 560 * desktopScale)
    main.ResponsiveAspect.AspectRatio = width / height
    main.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(width, height)
    main.Position = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, short and not narrow and 0.41 or 0.48)

    local headerWidth = math.min(width * 0.5, 320)
    header.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(headerWidth, compact and 36 or 56)
    header.Position = UDim2.new(0.5, 0, 0, compact and 8 or 12)
    header.CloseButton.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(compact and 44 or 48, compact and 44 or 48)
    header.CloseButton.Position = UDim2.fromOffset((width + headerWidth) / 2 - (compact and 60 or 64), compact and 0 or 4)

    local top = compact and 52 or 80
    local reserved = compact and 94 or 126
    for _, frame in ipairs({catalogue, details}) do
        frame.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(15, top)
        frame.Size = UDim2.new(1, -30, 1, -reserved)
    end

    local bodyWidth = width - 30
    local bodyHeight = height - reserved
    catalogue.IntroLabel.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(8, 0)
    catalogue.IntroLabel.Size = UDim2.new(1, -16, 0, compact and 24 or 28)
    local columns = bodyWidth >= (compact and 480 or 580)
    local cardHeight = compact and 92 or 118
    for index, card in ipairs(cards) do
        local column = columns and (index - 1) % 2 or 0
        local row = columns and math.floor((index - 1) / 2) or index - 1
        card.Position = UDim2.new(columns and column * 0.5 or 0, 8, 0, (compact and 32 or 40) + row * (cardHeight + 12))
        card.Size = UDim2.new(columns and 0.5 or 1, columns and -14 or -16, 0, cardHeight)
        local button = card:FindFirstChildWhichIsA("TextButton")
        button.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(12, compact and 8 or 10)
        button.Size = UDim2.new(1, -24, 0, compact and 40 or 50)
        card.PriceLabel.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(12, compact and 52 or 70)
        card.PriceLabel.Size = UDim2.new(1, -24, 0, compact and 18 or 24)
        card.OwnedLabel.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(12, compact and 72 or 96)
        card.OwnedLabel.Size = UDim2.new(1, -24, 0, compact and 16 or 18)
    end

    local scale = compact and 1 or math.clamp((bodyHeight - 12) / 384, 0.75, desktopScale)
    local centre = compact and bodyWidth * 0.25 or bodyWidth * 0.5
    local quantityCentre = compact and bodyWidth * 0.75 or centre
    local columnWidth = compact and bodyWidth / 2 or bodyWidth

    details.BackButton.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(compact and 44 or 44 * scale, compact and 44 or 44 * scale)
    details.BackButton.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(8, compact and 4 or 0)
    details.ItemHeaderFrame.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(math.min(320 * scale, columnWidth - (compact and 72 or 72 * scale)), compact and 44 or 50 * scale)
    details.ItemHeaderFrame.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(centre + (compact and 18 or 24 * scale), compact and 4 or 0)
    details.OwnedAndPriceFrame.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(math.min(400 * scale, columnWidth - 24), compact and 64 or 86 * scale)
    details.OwnedAndPriceFrame.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(centre, compact and 58 or 68 * scale)

    local buttonSize = compact and 44 or 54 * scale
    local amountWidth = compact and 96 or 150 * scale
    local amountHeight = compact and 44 or 54 * scale
    local quantityY = compact and 4 or 176 * scale
    local spacing = compact and 8 or 14 * scale
    details.SelectedAmountFrame.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(amountWidth, amountHeight)
    details.SelectedAmountFrame.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(quantityCentre, quantityY)
    details.MinusButton.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(buttonSize, buttonSize)
    details.MinusButton.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(quantityCentre - amountWidth / 2 - spacing - buttonSize, quantityY)
    details.PlusButton.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(buttonSize, buttonSize)
    details.PlusButton.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(quantityCentre + amountWidth / 2 + spacing, quantityY)
    details.ItemSellButtonFrame.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(math.min(248 * scale, columnWidth - 24), compact and 68 or 84 * scale)
    details.ItemSellButtonFrame.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(quantityCentre, compact and 54 or 286 * scale)

    main.FooterFrame.HintLabel.Visible = width >= 500
    main.FooterFrame.MoneyLabel.Size = UDim2.new(width >= 500 and 0.5 or 1, 0, 1, 0)
end

gui:GetPropertyChangedSignal("AbsoluteSize"):Connect(resize)
resize()

task.spawn(function()
    local player = Players.LocalPlayer
    local inventory = player:WaitForChild("Inventory")
    local money = player:WaitForChild("PlayerData"):WaitForChild("MoneyCents")
    local definitions = require(ReplicatedStorage:WaitForChild("Configs"):WaitForChild("ItemDefinitions"))

    local function refreshSummary()
        for _, card in ipairs(cards) do
            local button = card:FindFirstChildWhichIsA("TextButton")
            local itemName = button:GetAttribute("ItemName")
            local owned = 0
            for _, slot in ipairs(inventory:GetChildren()) do
                local name = slot:FindFirstChild("ItemName")
                local amount = slot:FindFirstChild("Amount")
                if name and amount and name.Value == itemName then owned += amount.Value end
            end
            local price = definitions[itemName].SellPriceCents
            card.PriceLabel.Text = string.format("$%.2f / each", price / 100)
            card.OwnedLabel.Text = "You have: " .. owned
        end
        main.FooterFrame.MoneyLabel.Text = string.format("Balance: $%.2f", money.Value / 100)
    end

    local function watch(value)
        if value:IsA("ValueBase") then value.Changed:Connect(refreshSummary) end
    end
    for _, value in ipairs(inventory:GetDescendants()) do watch(value) end
    inventory.DescendantAdded:Connect(function(value)
        watch(value)
        refreshSummary()
    end)
    money.Changed:Connect(refreshSummary)
    refreshSummary()
end)
]]></ProtectedString>
